---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import tostones from "../assets/tostones.jpg";
---

<section class="py-24 bg-white" id="story-section">
    <div class="max-w-350 mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2 order-2 lg:order-1">
                <div
                    class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest"
                >
                    Our Heritage
                </div>
                <h2
                    class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 leading-tight"
                >
                    The Story of Our Street Flavors
                </h2>
                <div
                    class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light"
                >
                    <p>
                        Our story is born in the vibrant streets of Havana,
                        where the aroma of garlic, cumin, and roasted pork
                        intertwines with the rhythm of everyday life. What
                        began as small family windows became a culinary
                        tradition that transcends borders.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Every sandwich and every dish we serve is a tribute to
                        those street cooks who, with ingenuity and passion,
                        perfected the art of "eating well" on the go. We honor
                        time-honored techniques, from the slow marinating of
                        mojo to the perfect toasting of Cuban bread.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Today, we bring that essence to your table. It's not
                        just food; it's a sensory journey through time and
                        culture, a route of flavors that celebrates the joy
                        and resilience of the Cuban spirit.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:w-1/2 order-1 lg:order-2">
                <div class="relative">
                    <div
                        class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-64 h-64 bg-secondary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-64 h-64 bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative"
                    >
                        <Image
                            src={tostones}
                            width={512}
                            height={512}
                            class="w-full h-150 object-cover"
                            alt="Authentic Cuban Street Food"
                        />
                        <div
                            class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/40 via-transparent to-transparent"
                        >
                        </div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-8 text-white">
                            <p class="text-4xl font-serif italic">
                                "The flavor that tells a story"
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
